\paragraph{Post-hoc pose-group sensitivity.}
The 15 analyzed scenarios share seven recorded pose configurations after ignoring the instruction and robot-asset names. To check this dependence, we resample these seven groups, keep all scenarios in each sampled group, and recompute the scenario-weighted mean: $\Delta=0.145$ $[0.075,0.236]$ (10,000 resamples, seed 20261023). Giving pose groups equal weight changes the estimand and yields $0.128$ $[0.070,0.204]$. These are post-hoc sensitivity intervals conditional on a small pose panel, not additional task-population evidence.

